# Pipeline run-time state lives here, one folder per run: <RUN-ID>/ where
# RUN-ID = <FEATURE-ID>-<YYYYMMDD-HHMM>. A reader only ever opens its own run's
# folder, so another run's artifact is unreachable rather than merely detectable.
# `latest` names the newest run, for humans. `multi-sprint-queue.md` is the one
# file that lives at this level on purpose: it is the list of runs, not a run.
# All of it is transient — safe to gitignore.
